From 3046362928df7511e3f32c7caaf8187fc024dd4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 18:46:25 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Make Photos and workspace/Uses images editable from Sanity
 Presentation

Add "Used on" locations for photo and workspace documents, main-document routes
for /:locale/photos (and workspace on /:locale/uses), and data-sanity attributes
on the photo, workspace and Uses images so the overlay opens the image field.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019Au13BHPjUgRvpqWWWW3dF
---
 .../photos/_components/photos-page.tsx        |  5 ++-
 .../[locale]/uses/_components/uses-page.tsx   | 18 ++++++++---
 port_v2/components/ui/layout-grid.tsx         |  4 +++
 port_v2/sanity/plugins/resolve.ts             | 32 ++++++++++++++++++-
 4 files changed, 53 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/port_v2/app/(public)/[locale]/photos/_components/photos-page.tsx b/port_v2/app/(public)/[locale]/photos/_components/photos-page.tsx
